<title>UK: GE Capital to take stake in SRF Finance.</title>
<headline>GE Capital to take stake in SRF Finance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>GE Capital Services said on Tuesday that it had reached an agreement with India's SRF Ltd to acquire a majority stake in its financial firm, SRF Finance Ltd.</p>
<p>GE did not specify the exact stake that it would take.</p>
</text>
